12分)\n（1）小球A由出发点运动到P位置过程中有，"},{"type":"math","value":"mg(H + R) = \\frac{1}{2}mv_{\\mathrm{P}}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"……1分\n在P位置有"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\mathrm{N}} - mg = \\frac{mv_{\\mathrm{P}}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"……1分\n联立解得"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\mathrm{N}} = 420\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"……1分\n（2）"},{"type":"math","value":"mg(H + R) - \\mu mg(L - s) = \\frac{1}{2}mv_0^2 - 0"},{"type":"text","value":"……1分\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_0 = 20\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"设碰撞后A的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{A}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，B的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{B}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，A、B发生弹性碰撞，根据动量守恒"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_0 = mv_{\\mathrm{A}} + Mv_{\\mathrm{B}}"},{"type":"text","value":"机械能守恒"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv_0^2 = \\frac{1}{2}mv_{\\mathrm{A}}^2 + \\frac{1}{2}Mv_{\\mathrm{B}}^2"},{"type":"text","value":"……1分(两个守恒式子任写一个就给分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{A}} = -10\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"(向左)，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{B}} = 10\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（向右）……1分\n(3)以A为研究对象，根据牛顿第二定律"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu mg = ma_{\\mathrm{A}}"},{"type":"text","value":"0.2s 内 A 向左的位移"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{A}=v_{A}t-\\frac{1}{2}a_{A}t^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{A}=1.9m"},{"type":"text","value":"（向左）……1 分\n薄板 B 的长度 s=2m，当 B 向右的位移为 x 时，根据牛顿第二定律"},{"type":"math","value":"kx+\\frac{\\mu Mg(s-x)}{s}=Ma_{B}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{B}=5m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，B 向右为匀变速运动 0.2s 内 B 的位移"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{B}=v_{B}t-\\frac{1}{2}a_{B}t^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{B}=1.9m"},{"type":"text","value":"（向右）……1 分\nA 与 B 左端距离"},{"type":"math","value":"d=x_{A}+x_{B}=3.8m"},{"type":"text","value":"……1 分\n（4）"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"时刻，B 向左运动，加速度为零（斜率为零），合力为零，设 B 进入光滑区长度为"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"由受力平衡可得"},{"type":"math","value":"kx_{1}=\\frac{\\mu Mg}{s}(s-x_{1})"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}=1m"},{"type":"text","value":"……1 分"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"时刻，B 开始向右运动，加速度为零，合力为零，B 板全在粗糙区内，设 B 板右端距离 O 点距离为"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"由受力平衡可得"},{"type":"math","value":"kx_{2}=\\mu Mg"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{2}=2m"},{"type":"text","value":"设"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"时刻 B 板右端距离 O 点距离为"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"，从碰撞结束到"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"的过程中，应用动能定理"},{"type":"math","value":"-\\left(\\frac{0+kx_{3}}{2}\\right)x_{3}-2\\left(\\frac{0+\\mu Mg}{2}\\right)s-\\mu Mgx_{3}=0-\\frac{1}{2}Mv_{B}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{3}=4m"},{"type":"text","value":"……1 分\n从"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"到"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"的时间内 B 与地面之间摩擦产生的热量为"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\frac{s-x_{1}}{s}\\mu Mg+\\mu Mg\\right)x_{1}+\\mu Mg(2x_{3}-x_{2})"},{"type":"text","value":"解得 Q=202.5J ……1 分"}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--taizhou-yimo-2611-q18","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--taizhou-yimo-2611","source_question_id":"taizhou-yimo-2611-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"da6861759683933e4e3c643e863156012fd42f52c6142646aff265e5ab022055","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）利用电容器放电产生的脉冲电流来驱动导体棒，是电磁弹射技术的核心原理。其示意图如图所示， "},{"type":"math","value":"PQ"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"MN"},{"type":"text","value":" 为两条足够长的光滑平行水平金属导轨，间距为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电阻忽略不计。导轨置于磁感应强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" ，方向竖直向下的匀强磁场中，导轨上有与之垂直并接触良好的导体棒 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" ，质量分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_1"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_2"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电阻均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" ，导轨左侧接有电容为 "},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":" 的电容器。初始时开关 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" 断开，给电容器充电使其电压为 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_0"},{"type":"text","value":" 且左极板带正电。开关闭合后，两导体棒开始运动且运动过程中两棒始终不发生碰撞。系统达到稳定状态后，电流为零，两导体棒速度相同\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1a560b8f6fa9012aaf32751fa371ad36e607aa884b579bcafe0bbe76595a259f.png","width":1121,"height":484,"width_mm":131.675,"row_group":"taizhou-yimo-2611-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图\n（1）求开关刚闭合瞬间，导体棒 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 所受的安培力大小与方向；\n（2）若 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}=m_{2}=m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，系统达到稳定状态前的某个时刻，导体棒 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 中的电流均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"I"},{"type":"text","value":"，求此刻电容器电压；\n（3）若 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2} > m_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求系统达到稳定状态后两导体棒的速度；要使两导体棒不相撞，二者在初始时刻的间距 "},{"type":"math","value":"d"},{"type":"text","value":" 至少为多少？\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13 分）\n（1）由左手定则可知 a 棒所受安培力向右 ……1 分\na 棒上电流"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{1}=\\frac{U_{0}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"所受安培力"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{1}=BI_{1}L=\\frac{BLU_{0}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"……2 分\n（2）设此刻电容器电压为 U，两棒速度为 v，从开关闭合到该时刻流过各棒的电荷量为 Q，则有："},{"type":"math","value":"U=BLv+IR"},{"type":"text","value":"……1 分"},{"type":"math","value":"BLQ=mv"},{"type":"text","value":"……1 分"},{"type":"math","value":"2Q=CU_{0}-CU"},{"type":"text","value":"……1 分\n可得"},{"type":"math","value":"U=\\frac{B^{2}L^{2}CU_{0}+2mIR}{2m+B^{2}L^{2}C}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分\n（3）设稳定后两棒速度为 v，电容器电压为 U，全过程流过 a 棒的电荷量为"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，流过棒的电荷量为"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则有"},{"type":"math","value":"BLQ_{1}=m_{1}v"},{"type":"math","value":"BLQ_{2}=m_{2}v"},{"type":"text","value":"U=BLv ..... 1 分"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{1}+Q_{2}=CU_{0}-CU"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分\n可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{BLCU_{0}}{m_{1}+m_{2}+B^{2}L^{2}C}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分\n同时可解得"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{1}=\\frac{m_{1}CU_{0}}{m_{1}+m_{2}+B^{2}L^{2}C}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{2}=\\frac{m_{2}CU_{0}}{m_{1}+m_{2}+B^{2}L^{2}C}"},{"type":"text","value":",\n结合（2）问分析，在任意时刻有"},{"type":"math","value":"U=BLv_{1}+I_{1}R=BLv_{2}+I_{2}R"},{"type":"text","value":"即"},{"type":"math","value":"BL(v_{1}-v_{2})=I_{2}R-I_{1}R"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分\n对该式两边取微元累积有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum BL(v_{1}-v_{2})\\Delta t=\\sum I_{2}R\\Delta t-\\sum I_{1}R\\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"其中"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum(v_{1}-v_{2})\\Delta t=x_{1}-x_{2}=d_{min},\\quad\\sum I_{1}\\Delta t=Q_{1},\\sum I_{2}\\Delta t=Q_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"即"},{"type":"math","value":"BLD_{\\min}=(Q_{2}-Q_{1})R"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分\n两棒间初始距离的最小值为"},{"type":"math","value":"d_{\\min}=\\frac{(m_{2}-m_{1})CRU_{0}}{BL(m_{1}+m_{2}+B^{2}L^{2}C)}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... 1 分"}]}}]}
